# Ignore .omc contents (state, sessions, project-memory) but KEEP learned skills.
#
# Two subtleties, both of which bit once:
#  - `/.omc/*` not `/.omc/`: a trailing-slash exclude stops Git descending into the directory
#    at all, so a negation inside it could never re-include anything.
#  - A pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's directory, so `/.omc/*` matches
#    the root one ONLY. Stray `.omc` dirs get written elsewhere in the tree by tooling
#    (e.g. app/src/main/res/font/.omc), and the plain `.omc/` this replaced caught them at
#    any depth. `**/*/.omc/` restores that for everything below the root.
/.omc/*
!/.omc/skills/
**/*/.omc/
.gstack/
.kotlin/
*.jks
*.keystore
.claude/PRPs/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# fastlane / Play publishing — never commit the service-account key
fastlane/play-service-account.json
fastlane/*.json
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md
